  "reference": "Bahebulania 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kalamīje ka ng'wiheema lya mu sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, nī lilagane ī lya kwandya lyalī nayo ī milonjo ya kalamīje ū mu sī; lyalī nalyo nī lipandī ī lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī liheema īlo līkabeejiwa lyalī na mapandī abīlī, ī lipandī ī lya kwandya litanagwa lyeela. Ū ng'wenūmo yikalaga mo tala na meza, na migatī ya kūtūūlwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī lipandī ī lya kabīlī, ū kū mpīndo y'isenge, ī lyene litanagwa lyeela no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wipandī lyenīlo gwalīmo ng'walīlo gwa zahabu, lyalīmo n'isandīko ly'ilagane līnaagīlilwe zahabu kose kose. Ū ng'wisandīko lyenīlo yalīmo shinje ya zahabu yokalile mana, gwalīmo na nang'ha gūfulumile, gwa ng'wa Alooni, gaalīmo na mabalala ga mawe ayo gaalī gandīkilwe ī lilagane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya y'isandīko gaalīho makelubi g'ikūjo, galīfīkīgije ī Lisumbī lya shigongo. Gwike ī haha tūtūdūla ū kūmuwīla pyī ī mihayo yenīyo gūmò gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho shamalīīla ū kūbeejiwa ī shikolo ī shose īshi, a bagabīji bakayingīla gwa gwa gwa ū ng'wiheema kūja kūshikīlīja milonjo ya būtūmami wabo, ū ng'wipandī ī lya kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ng'wipandī ī lya kabīlī, ū ng'wene wingīlaga Ngabīji Ntaale iyene, nīyo kamò dūhū ū mu ng'waka; hama walī atingīlaga ūlū atī na mininga ga kūfunya kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi bokwe nū wa banhū, ū bo kwītwa mu būtūmana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko ū Moyo Ng'wela oolechaga gīkī, ī nzīla ya kwingīla ng'wipandī lyeela no no no yalī ītaalī ū kwigela; aho lyalī lītaalī lyīmīīlile ī liheema lya kwandya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlo līlī shigemelo sh'ikanza lya haha. Ū ng'wenūmo shafunyiagwa shakwinha na shitambo īsho shitadūgije kūshikanya wiyangūji bo namya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī yenīyo īlī mihayo ya malange ga mu mīlī dūhū; īlī mihayo ya shilīwa na shakūng'wa, na mbika jingī na jingī ja kūkooba wela. Ī mihayo yenīyo yalī yigelile ībize gīko, kūshisha līshike ī likanza lya mihayo kwītwa kūbiza mipya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mininga ga ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Kilisito akiza kūbiza Ngabīji Ntaale wa mihayo yawiza īyo īlīho, wingīla ng'wiheema itaale na lyawiza kūtinda, īlo lītī lya kūbeejiwa na makono; nīyo lītabeejiwe kwīngīīla mu shiseeng'wa sha mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo hangī ū wei atingīlile na mininga ga mbūli nūūlū ga ndama, alīyo na mininga gakwe we ng'wenekīlī. Aho wamala kūpandīka būkomooji butashilaga, wingīla lūkangala lūmò lwenūlo dūhū ū ng'wipandī ī lyeela no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno abo batī beela ūlū baseeseebelwa mininga ga mbūli na ga nzagamba, na mabu ga ndogoosa, bakeelaga babiza batī na shilingo ū mu mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya a mininga ga ng'wa Kilisito ūyo atī na shilingo, ūyo akifunya wei ng'wenekīlī kūlī Mulungu mulī Moyo wa welelo bose, a gene gadūgije kūweja na kūtinda ho ū wiyangūji bo mung'holò jise twīnge ū mu milīmo īyo īchile, tūbize batūmami ba ng'wa Mulungu mpanga!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsangīja wawiza kūtinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū ng'wene alī Ntūūji w'ilagane ipya, gīkī a bitanwa banukūle ū wisagījiwa kūlwa wingīji butashilaga; nguno akacha kūlwa kūbakomoola kūfuma ū mu būhūbi ūbo walī wītwa ng'wikanza ly'ilagane lya kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īmanīkile gīkī, aho līlīho ilagane kūlwa nguno ya wingīji, nū kūcha kwa ntūūji walyo shiigelile koolechiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī lilagane lya wingīji līkabizaga na nguzu ūlū lūfu lwigela; alīyo ūlū ataalī mpanga ū ntūūji walyo lītabizaga na nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene nī lilagane lya kwandya lītatūūlilwe dūhū mu būtidīka mininga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Musa aho wamala kūbawīla a banhū pyī ī shilagīlo ūmo gahayīlile a malange, akasola mininga ga ndama na ga mbūli, hamò na minzī; ūsola na booya wa ng'holo yaza, n'itambī lya ntī gwa husopo, ūshiseeseebela ī shitabo, na a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya gīkī, “A genaya galī mininga g'ilagane lya ng'wa Mulungu īlo wang'winhaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī liheema akalīseeseebela, pyī nī shiseme ī sha kūtūmamīla mu myatīla ya būlamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū mu shilagīlo hihī būlī shikolo shikeejiagwa na mininga, nīyo ūlū mininga gatidīkile būtīho būlekejiwa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwifunya kwa ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ī shiikolanījo sha shikolo sha ng'wigūlū shalī shiigeleelilwe kwejiwa na shitambo shenīsho, alīyo ī shikolo sha ng'wigūlū shenekīlī, shilī sha kwejiwa na shitambo shawiza kūtinda shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Kilisito atingīlile ng'wiheema lyeela lya kūbeejiwa na makono, ipandī īlo līlī shiikolanījo dūhū ū kū shikolo ī sha ng'hana. Alī ng'wigūlū henekīlī, ī haha alī kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu kūlwa nguno yise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ītī gīkī ikale akwifunyaga ng'hangala na ng'hangala gīt'ūmo Ngabīji Ntaale akingīlaga ng'wipandī lyeela no no no būlī ng'waka, nīyo na mininga ayo gatī gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
